---
const instagramFeed = [
  { url: 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1570172619644-dfd03ed5d881?w=400&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80', alt: 'Facial Luxury Treatment Room' },
  { url: 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1512290900673-70020108990c?w=400&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80', alt: 'Aesthetic Skincare Care Products' },
  { url: 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1540555700478-4be289fbecef?w=400&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80', alt: 'Relaxing Spa Oil Therapy' },
  { url: 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1487412720507-e7ab37603c6f?w=400&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80', alt: 'Glowing Skin Consultation' },
];
---

<footer class="bg-[#07050A] text-gray-400 border-t border-pink-950/40 relative overflow-hidden pt-16 pb-12">
  <!-- Glowing Background Orbs -->
  <div class="absolute top-0 right-1/4 w-96 h-96 bg-pink-600/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
  <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-10 w-96 h-96 bg-purple-600/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    <!-- Proof Points Banner Strip inside Footer -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-5 gap-4 py-8 mb-12 border-y border-pink-950/50 bg-pink-950/20 rounded-2xl px-6">
      <div class="text-center">
        <span class="block text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-extrabold font-serif text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-pink-400 to-amber-300">10+ Tahun</span>
        <span class="text-xs text-gray-400 uppercase font-semibold">Berpengalaman</span>
      </div>
      <div class="text-center">
        <span class="block text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-extrabold font-serif text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-pink-400 to-amber-300">15.000+</span>
        <span class="text-xs text-gray-400 uppercase font-semibold">Pelanggan Puas</span>
      </div>
      <div class="text-center">
        <span class="block text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-extrabold font-serif text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-pink-400 to-amber-300">25+</span>
        <span class="text-xs text-gray-400 uppercase font-semibold">Terapis Profesional</span>
      </div>
      <div class="text-center">
        <span class="block text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-extrabold font-serif text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-pink-400 to-amber-300">50+</span>
        <span class="text-xs text-gray-400 uppercase font-semibold">Treatment Tersedia</span>
      </div>
      <div class="text-center col-span-2 md:col-span-1">
        <span class="block text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-extrabold font-serif text-amber-400">4.9 / 5.0 ★</span>
        <span class="text-xs text-gray-400 uppercase font-semibold">Rating Pelanggan</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-10">
      <!-- Column 1: Brand & Differentiator -->
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-tr from-[#E6007A] to-[#8B5CF6] p-[2px]">
            <div class="w-full h-full bg-[#0C0A10] rounded-[10px] flex items-center justify-center">
              <span class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-pink-400">A</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <span class="font-serif text-2xl font-extrabold text-white">AURA</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-300">
          Kami menghadirkan pengalaman perawatan kecantikan yang mewah, nyaman, dan personal dengan didukung oleh terapis profesional, produk premium, serta standar kebersihan yang tinggi. Setiap treatment dirancang untuk memberikan hasil optimal sekaligus pengalaman relaksasi yang berkesan.
        </p>
        <div class="pt-2">
          <div class="client-data-badge">
            ⚠️ [PERLU DATA CLIENT: Cabang & Alamat Lengkap]
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Column 2: Navigation Links -->
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <h4 class="font-serif text-lg font-bold text-white tracking-wide border-l-2 border-pink-500 pl-3">
          Navigasi Utama
        </h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
          <li><a href="/" class="hover:text-pink-400 transition-colors flex items-center gap-2"><span>›</span> Home Showcase</a></li>
          <li><a href="/tentang-kami" class="hover:text-pink-400 transition-colors flex items-center gap-2"><span>›</span> Tentang Kami & Profil Terapis</a></li>
          <li><a href="/layanan" class="hover:text-pink-400 transition-colors flex items-center gap-2"><span>›</span> Daftar Layanan & Harga</a></li>
          <li><a href="/treatment" class="hover:text-pink-400 transition-colors flex items-center gap-2"><span>›</span> Signature Treatments</a></li>
          <li><a href="/promo" class="hover:text-pink-400 transition-colors flex items-center gap-2"><span>›</span> Promo & Membership VIP</a></li>
          <li><a href="/blog" class="hover:text-pink-400 transition-colors flex items-center gap-2"><span>›</span> Blog Tips Kecantikan</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Column 3: Contact & Hours -->
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <h4 class="font-serif text-lg font-bold text-white tracking-wide border-l-2 border-pink-500 pl-3">
          Lokasi & Jam Buka
        </h4>
        <div class="text-sm space-y-3">
          <div>
            <span class="block text-white font-semibold">📍 Alamat Studio Utama</span>
            <span class="text-gray-400">Jl. Senopati No. 88, Kebayoran Baru, Jakarta Selatan</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="block text-white font-semibold">🕒 Jam Operasional</span>
            <span class="text-gray-400">Senin - Minggu: 09.00 - 20.00 WIB</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="block text-white font-semibold">📞 Kontak & WhatsApp</span>
            <a href="https://wa.me/6281234567890" target="_blank" class="text-pink-400 hover:underline font-bold">
              +62 812-3456-7890 (WA Fast Response)
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Column 4: Instagram Feed Preview -->
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <h4 class="font-serif text-lg font-bold text-white tracking-wide border-l-2 border-pink-500 pl-3">
          Instagram Feed @aura.aesthetic
        </h4>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2">
          {instagramFeed.map((img) => (
            <a href="https://instagram.com" target="_blank" class="group relative aspect-square overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-gray-900 border border-white/10">
              <img src={img.url} alt={img.alt} class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500" loading="lazy" />
              <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-pink-950/60 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity flex items-center justify-center">
                <span class="text-white text-xs font-bold">@aura.aesthetic</span>
              </div>
            </a>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Bar -->
    <div class="mt-12 pt-6 border-t border-white/10 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between text-xs text-gray-500 gap-4">
      <p>© 2026 AURA Aesthetic & Beauty Lounge. Hak Cipta Dilindungi Undang-Undang.</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-6">
        <a href="#privacy" class="hover:text-gray-300">Kebijakan Privasi</a>
        <a href="#terms" class="hover:text-gray-300">Syarat & Ketentuan</a>
        <a href="#accessibility" class="hover:text-gray-300">Standar WCAG 2.1</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
